      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements:\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements:\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HOUu4yK5AhNfZlQN_5iik",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 289.06469711490433,
      "y": 341.1354120781498,
      "width": 600.4794921875,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1111016273,
      "version": 709,
      "versionNonce": 146722833,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790845286669,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. User should be able to search movies, theatre, shows etc.\n2. User can select any movie, show, theatre etc.\n3. User can select seats from seatmap for a show.\n4. User can book selected seats.\n5. Seats will be locked when booling initiated\n6. User will pay for the selected seats\n7. User will be notified on successful booking\n8. On failed booking seats will be available\n9. User can cancel their booking\n10. Handling of popular events/movies etc.\n11. Handlng millions of user concurrently trying to book a seat",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User should be able to search movies, theatre, shows etc.\n2. User can select any movie, show, theatre etc.\n3. User can select seats from seatmap for a show.\n4. User can book selected seats.\n5. Seats will be locked when booling initiated\n6. User will pay for the selected seats\n7. User will be notified on successful booking\n8. On failed booking seats will be available\n9. User can cancel their booking\n10. Handling of popular events/movies etc.\n11. Handlng millions of user concurrently trying to book a seat",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LfJssn5t0OcXYVwgSjr5B",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 289.6905367154115,
      "y": 590.2108309649892,
      "width": 283.01971435546875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
