      "text": "Entites: \nMovies, Theatre, Show, Seats, SeatMap, Booking\nPayments, Notification\n\nGET      /SearchService?query={}\nPOST     /BookingService\n             - Seats[]\n             - userId\n             - showId\n\nPATCH    /BookingService/:bookingId\n             - Seats[]\n             - userId\n             - showId\n\nDELETE  /BookingService/:bookingId\nGET       /BookingService/:bookingId\n\nWS       /SeatMapService/:showId/:seats",
